record shows no SEC investigation or enforcement.\"},\n{\"id\": \"K070\", \"issue\": \"not_stated\", \"consequence\": \"incorrect\", \"contradiction\": \"yes\", \"record_exists\": \"yes\", \"reason\": \"The claimed SEC enforcement or investigation is not in the record, which shows no AAER.\"},\n{\"id\": \"K224\", \"issue\": \"not_stated\", \"consequence\": \"correct\", \"contradiction\": \"no\", \"record_exists\": \"yes\", \"reason\": \"Quarterly restatements fit the Q2 2018 non-reliance and the 10-K was delayed; the record does not cover auditor resignation.\"},\n{\"id\": \"K011\", \"issue\": \"not_stated\", \"consequence\": \"incorrect\", \"contradiction\": \"yes\", \"record_exists\": \"yes\", \"reason\": \"The record shows no AAER, so the claimed SEC enforcement action conflicts with it.\"},\n{\"id\": \"K217\", \"issue\": \"not_stated\", \"consequence\": \"incorrect\", \"contradiction\": \"yes\", \"record_exists\": \"yes\", \"reason\": \"The record does not show the claimed SEC charges.\"},\n{\"id\": \"K187\", \"issue\": \"not_stated\", \"consequence\": \"correct\", \"contradiction\": \"no\", \"record_exists\": \"yes\", \"reason\": \"The restated 2018 interim results match the June 30, 2018 10-Q non-reliance, and the 10-K was late.\"},\n{\"id\": \"K110\", \"issue\": \"not_stated\", \"consequence\": \"correct\", \"contradiction\": \"no\", \"record_exists\": \"yes\", \"reason\": \"The late FY2018 10-K and the restatement fit the record.\"},\n{\"id\": \"K010\", \"issue\": \"mismatch\", \"consequence\": \"correct\", \"contradiction\": \"no\", \"record_exists\": \"yes\", \"reason\": \"The very late 10-K and later corrections fit the record; acquisition accounting differs from the derivative and notes-payable errors.\"}\n]\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3662,"cache_read_input_tokens":1520,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_token